{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "bbdeveloper-pix-collection",
    "name": "BB Developer - PIX (Cob e CobV)",
    "description": "Collection para testar a API local BBDeveloper.\n\nA aplicação Spring obtém o token OAuth2 + mTLS internamente — não é necessário enviar Authorization nas requisições.\n\n**Regras do BB:**\n- `txid`: 26 a 35 caracteres alfanuméricos [a-zA-Z0-9]\n- Listagem: intervalo entre `inicio` e `fim` deve ser menor que 5 dias\n\n**Variáveis da collection:**\n- `baseUrl` — URL da aplicação (padrão: http://localhost:8080)\n- `pixKey` — chave PIX cadastrada no BB (mesmo valor de `bb.pix-key`)\n- `txid` / `txidCobv` — gerados automaticamente se inválidos\n- `inicio` / `fim` — período de listagem (máx. 4 dias)\n\n**Ordem sugerida de testes:**\n1. Teste rápido (POST /pix/cobrancas)\n2. Criar Cob (PUT /pix/cob/{txid})\n3. Consultar Cob\n4. Criar CobV (PUT /pix/cobv/{txid})\n5. Consultar CobV",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080"
    },
    {
      "key": "pixKey",
      "value": "hmtestes2@bb.com.br"
    },
    {
      "key": "txid",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "txidCobv",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "inicio",
      "value": "2026-06-05T00:00:00Z"
    },
    {
      "key": "fim",
      "value": "2026-06-08T23:59:59Z"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Autenticação",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Gerar Token (teste direto)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/token",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["token"]
            },
            "description": "Opcional. Testa a geração de token OAuth2 diretamente. Os endpoints PIX não precisam deste token — a aplicação gera internamente."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Teste Rápido",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Criar Cobrança (dados fixos)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    if (body.txid) {",
                  "        pm.collectionVariables.set('txid', body.txid);",
                  "        console.log('txid salvo:', body.txid);",
                  "    }",
                  "    pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "    pm.test('Possui pixCopiaECola', () => pm.expect(body.pixCopiaECola).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/pix/cobrancas",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["pix", "cobrancas"]
            },
            "description": "Endpoint original de teste. Cria uma Cob com dados hardcoded no PixService — valida autenticação e integração com o BB."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Cob (Cobrança Imediata)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Criar Cob (PUT com txid)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const txidAtual = pm.collectionVariables.get('txid');",
                  "const txidValido = txidAtual && /^[a-zA-Z0-9]{26,35}$/.test(txidAtual);",
                  "if (!txidValido) {",
                  "    const chars = 'abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyzABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ0123456789';",
                  "    let txid = '';",
                  "    for (let i = 0; i < 32; i++) {",
                  "        txid += chars.charAt(Math.floor(Math.random() * chars.length));",
                  "    }",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('txid', txid);",
                  "    console.log('txid gerado:', txid);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    if (body.txid) pm.collectionVariables.set('txid', body.txid);",
                  "    pm.test('Cob criada', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"calendario\": {\n    \"expiracao\": 3600\n  },\n  \"devedor\": {\n    \"cpf\": \"12345678909\",\n    \"nome\": \"Francisco da Silva\"\n  },\n  \"valor\": {\n    \"original\": \"1.00\"\n  },\n  \"chave\": \"{{pixKey}}\",\n  \"solicitacaoPagador\": \"Pagamento de teste Pix\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/pix/cob/{{txid}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["pix", "cob", "{{txid}}"]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Criar Cob sem txid (POST)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    if (body.txid) pm.collectionVariables.set('txid', body.txid);",
                  "    pm.test('Cob criada', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"calendario\": {\n    \"expiracao\": 3600\n  },\n  \"devedor\": {\n    \"cpf\": \"12345678909\",\n    \"nome\": \"Francisco da Silva\"\n  },\n  \"valor\": {\n    \"original\": \"1.00\"\n  },\n  \"chave\": \"{{pixKey}}\",\n  \"solicitacaoPagador\": \"Pagamento de teste Pix\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/pix/cob",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["pix", "cob"]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Consultar Cob",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/pix/cob/{{txid}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["pix", "cob", "{{txid}}"]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Revisar Cob",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"valor\": {\n    \"original\": \"2.00\"\n  }\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/pix/cob/{{txid}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["pix", "cob", "{{txid}}"]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Listar Cobs",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/pix/cob?inicio={{inicio}}&fim={{fim}}&paginaAtual=0&itensPorPagina=10",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["pix", "cob"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "inicio", "value": "{{inicio}}" },
                { "key": "fim", "value": "{{fim}}" },
                { "key": "cpf", "value": "12345678909", "disabled": true },
                { "key": "cnpj", "value": "", "disabled": true },
                { "key": "status", "value": "ATIVA", "disabled": true },
                { "key": "paginaAtual", "value": "0" },
                { "key": "itensPorPagina", "value": "10" }
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Cancelar Cob",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/pix/cob/{{txid}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["pix", "cob", "{{txid}}"]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "CobV (Cobrança com Vencimento)",
